    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Fatou-xoxo",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106292521394536014300/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVXb0Iz_PJFN7rU8_UvbDT6yHmtgltFOgCKuOOl8V0YVKWUUhXQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Mr. Reda advised my brother and me on the purchase of our first duplex. His expertise, his attentive listening, and the time he dedicated to us ensured that the buying process went very smoothly. He has a critical eye for complex elements such as plumbing, structure, land, etc. He helped my parents with their real estate investments, and it was all a success. My brother and I couldn't have found anyone better. We are extremely grateful for his help!",
        "time": 1733518041,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "auxence GBEDAN",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104552674375829884956/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVNRqI-hGEIFBoaj9h_hby8PDTihtQzS33CyjycTJ62tfpzIDw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "We had a very positive experience working with Reda Jamil on our transactions (buying, selling, and renting).\n\nWe have been working with Reda since 2016-2017 and highly recommend him for his professionalism, integrity, and availability!",
        "time": 1733501901,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Simon Adam",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117465735614755299936/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIBOC_9-RJN-NTTin66I-kFEpmkJXdGehlG0l9uhPp3PFDVYA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "I went to see this broker with my wife in 2019, we had no properties and since then, we have been able to build a real estate portfolio that now includes 5 buildings and our portfolio continues to grow. Reda believed in us young people and he continues to believe in us. What makes him so good is that his motivation for his job is not only financial but he is motivated by a desire for accomplishment and success. An anecdote that gave me confidence in Reda, during the negotiations for the purchase of a plex, I had given Reda an amount that we were ready to pay and he managed to conclude much lower than this amount. He worked hard to save us money. He put the interest of his clients before his own interest.",
        "time": 1676168143,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Andre Vaillancourt",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104898767619968324481/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVuWF-kE26VmtbX5gKwc34XTPCHmNC5FyRwo923wQ_B_EqYtyI35w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "I've sold several houses in my life through Re/Max, and Reda is by far the best agent my wife and I have ever dealt with. What an efficient agent, so determined to sell! After more than five months with another company, Reda sold our house in two weeks, even exceeding the asking price. He listens carefully and makes sure we understand all the paperwork. He goes the extra mile to be helpful, and that's greatly appreciated. Well done, Reda!",
        "time": 1579715667,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kathia Jean Charles",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116144705219431636514/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL_lvAKAQpQnjSvWml3sz5OvpyR6GrucMtpNixTt4iU_W2fAQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Reda Reda Reda! Since my husband and I met him. He is now part of our projects. Thanks to his advice, his listening, and his availability our projects were more successful than we hoped. Thank you so much for being there for our family and we appreciate you enormously. If we had to do it all over again, we wouldn't change anything. Super Reda. 🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰",
        "time": 1676168265,
